## Quick Reference

### Theme structure

* Organization: `@010-technosapiens-conventions.mdc`
* Templates: `@030-php-html-templating.mdc`

### Writing code

* PHP: `@030-php-html-templating.mdc` and `@015-code-formatting-consistency.mdc`
* Security: `@020-security.mdc` (REST, nonces, CSRF; not always-on)
* Accessibility: `@025-wcag.mdc` (WCAG 2.1 AA; not always-on)
* JS: `@040-javascript-organization.mdc`, `@041-javascript-oop-patterns.mdc`, `@042-javascript-code-splitting.mdc`, `@043-javascript-best-practices.mdc`
* SCSS: `@055-scss-styling-conventions.mdc`, `@050-responsive-media-queries.mdc`

### Features

* Sections: `@060-create-section.mdc` and `@065-section-development.mdc`
* Images: `@070-image-handling.mdc`
* Post types: `@080-post-types-conventions.mdc`
* Client docs: `@090-client-documentation.mdc`

## Debugging

```php
use TechnoSapiens\Core\Log;
Log::log($variableToInspect);
```

Check `debug.log` and the browser console. Follow `@015-code-formatting-consistency.mdc`.
